<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East Bank par value cut to 10 pesos.</title>
<headline>Far East Bank par value cut to 10 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co's shares par value was brought down to 10 pesos from 100 pesos with effect from Monday, Philippine Stock Exchange research head Sergio Marguez said.</p>
<p>Accordingly, he said, previous closing prices would have to be adjusted to reflect this change. Far East Bank's closing price last Friday was revised to 89 pesos from 890 pesos, he said. - Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
